description=Drive through the undergrowth and it stays gone. Bushes and young trees die under wheels for every driver, dropping whatever felling them would drop. Staff can also arm a timed sweep from the right-click menu, which clears the same bushes and saplings from every area as it loads - for a world that erosion has overgrown. Mature trees are always left standing. It cannot remove the collision slowdown itself - that lives in the game's Java and no Lua event reaches it - but the bush is not there the next time you come down that road. Settings in Admin Panel - Sandbox Options - Wabbajack Trailblazer.
